Verse timings of Badr Al-Turki's recitation (segments.json)

Taken from "Quranic-Recitation-Data" by zaibihassan,
https://huggingface.co/datasets/zaibihassan/Quranic-Recitation-Data (badr-al-turki-murattal),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this folder).

Changes: only the start and end time of each verse inside its surah were used (no word times,
no audio from that dataset); verse starts were moved up to 120 ms earlier; verse 1 of each surah
starts at 0; written in the format of this repository.

The audio is streamed from quranicaudio.com and, for surahs 13 and 20, from mp3quran.net.
